### ========================================
### TESTES DE APROVAÇÃO DE VENDAS
### ========================================

### 1. Criar Venda para Teste
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "status": "QUOTE",
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "installments": 3,
  "shippingCost": 50.00,
  "shippingModality": 0,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 100.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar o saleId da resposta: {{saleId}}

###

### 2. Aprovar Venda (Cria Contas a Receber + Movimenta Estoque)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Buscar Venda Aprovada (com todos os vínculos)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 4. Listar Contas a Receber da Venda
GET http://localhost:3000/api/financial/accounts-receivable?saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 5. Listar Movimentações de Estoque da Venda
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stock/movements?saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 6. Cancelar Venda (Reverte Contas a Receber + Devolve Estoque)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancellationReason": "Cliente desistiu da compra"
}

###

### 7. Verificar Contas a Receber Após Cancelamento
GET http://localhost:3000/api/financial/accounts-receivable?saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Todas devem estar com status = CANCELADO

###

### 8. Verificar Movimentações Após Cancelamento
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stock/movements?saleId={{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve ter movimentações tipo EXIT e RETURN

###

### ========================================
### CENÁRIOS DE ERRO
### ========================================

### Erro: Tentar aprovar venda sem método de pagamento
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "status": "QUOTE",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 50.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar ID: {{saleWithoutPaymentId}}

###

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleWithoutPaymentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar: "Venda deve ter um método de pagamento definido"

###

### Erro: Estoque Insuficiente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 99999,
      "unitPrice": 50.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar ID: {{saleInsufficientStockId}}

###

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleInsufficientStockId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar: "Estoque insuficiente para [Produto] no local selecionado"

###

### Erro: Aprovar Venda Já Aprovada
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{saleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar: "Venda já está aprovada"

###

### Erro: Aprovar Venda Cancelada
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{canceledSaleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar: "Venda cancelada não pode ser aprovada"

###

### ========================================
### FLUXO COMPLETO: Orçamento → Aprovação → NFe
### ========================================

### Passo 1: Criar Orçamento
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "status": "QUOTE",
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "installments": 2,
  "shippingCost": 75.00,
  "shippingModality": 0,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 150.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar: {{completeSaleId}}

###

### Passo 2: Aprovar Venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{completeSaleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Passo 3: Verificar Contas a Receber Criadas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/financial/accounts-receivable?saleId={{completeSaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve ter 2 parcelas criadas automaticamente

###

### Passo 4: Verificar Estoque Foi Movimentado
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stock/movements?saleId={{completeSaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve ter 1 movimentação tipo EXIT

###

### Passo 5: Mudar Status para Confirmado
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{completeSaleId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

###

### Passo 6: Emitir NFe da Venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/nfe/from-sale
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "{{completeSaleId}}",
  "serie": "1",
  "naturezaOperacao": "Venda de mercadoria",
  "tipoOperacao": 1,
  "finalidade": 1
}

###

### ========================================
### TESTE DE PARCELAMENTO
### ========================================

### Venda Parcelada em 4x
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "installments": 4,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1000.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar: {{installmentSaleId}}

###

### Aprovar e Verificar Parcelas
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{installmentSaleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Listar as 4 Contas a Receber
GET http://localhost:3000/api/financial/accounts-receivable?saleId={{installmentSaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve retornar 4 parcelas de R$ 250,00 cada

###

### ========================================
### TESTE DE MÚLTIPLOS PRODUTOS
### ========================================

### Venda com Múltiplos Produtos
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "installments": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId1}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 50.00
    },
    {
      "productId": "{{productId2}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 100.00
    },
    {
      "productId": "{{productId3}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 200.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar: {{multiProductSaleId}}

###

### Aprovar Venda Múltiplos Produtos
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{multiProductSaleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Verificar Movimentações (deve ter 3)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stock/movements?saleId={{multiProductSaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve ter 3 movimentações, uma para cada produto

###

### ========================================
### TESTE DE CANCELAMENTO E DEVOLUÇÃO
### ========================================

### Criar e Aprovar Venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "installments": 2,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "stockLocationId": "{{stockLocationId}}",
      "quantity": 8,
      "unitPrice": 75.00
    }
  ]
}

# Salvar: {{cancelTestSaleId}}

###

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{cancelTestSaleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Verificar Estoque ANTES do Cancelamento
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Anotar o currentStock

###

### Cancelar Venda
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales/{{cancelTestSaleId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancellationReason": "Teste de cancelamento - validar devolução de estoque"
}

###

### Verificar Estoque APÓS Cancelamento
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# currentStock deve ter voltado ao valor original (+8)

###

### Verificar Movimentações de RETURN
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stock/movements?saleId={{cancelTestSaleId}}&type=RETURN
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Deve ter movimentação tipo RETURN com quantity = +8

###

### Verificar Contas a Receber Canceladas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/financial/accounts-receivable?saleId={{cancelTestSaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# Todas devem estar com status = CANCELADO

###

### ========================================
### DASHBOARD - ESTATÍSTICAS
### ========================================

### Listar Todas as Vendas Aprovadas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales?status=APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Dashboard de Vendas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ========================================
### VARIÁVEIS DE AMBIENTE (Configure estas)
### ========================================

# authToken = seu-token-jwt-aqui
# customerId = uuid-do-cliente
# productId = uuid-do-produto
# stockLocationId = uuid-do-local-estoque
# paymentMethodId = uuid-do-metodo-pagamento
